class CiscoWanLpbkTypes(TextualConvention, Integer32):
    description = 'Defines possible loopback configurations for a connection:\n           noLoopback    : no loopback or clear configured loopback\n           destructive   : loopback all cells, causing data disruption.\n           nonDestructive: loopback performed using OAM loopback cells.\n                           Does not disrupt regular traffic.'
